# Barkly Access — Complete UI Reconstruction, Frequent Directory, Analytics Dashboard & PAW-HC Accessibility

## Project Context

Barkly Access is a modular BetterDiscord accessibility project built around PAW-HC (People Are Worth Designing For).

The philosophy is:

**People Are Worth Designing For. Technology should adapt to people, not force people to adapt to technology.**

The current display/UI is not functioning correctly and needs a comprehensive investigation and reconstruction. This is not a request for superficial CSS fixes. Audit the existing implementation and rebuild the display layer into a cohesive, maintainable, accessible and functional system.

The project already has existing functionality, architecture, collection logic, persistence, analytics and modules. Inspect the actual codebase before making assumptions.

Do not blindly rewrite functioning infrastructure just because the UI needs rebuilding.

